    "summary": "The breaking apiVersion 2 (010 D15): every project-scoped fact moves under /api/projects/<name>/, the project collection gains registration and arm/disarm controls, and genuinely global facts (daemon meta with standby state, account quota, the SSE stream) stay global with a project field on every event. v1 routes are retired, not aliased; the corpus's own pin-invalidation absorbs the break. Envelope, honesty, bounded-event, and route-table-driven client rules from 022 carry over verbatim.\n",
